{"3713090": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Animal Run Relay", "steam_appid": 3713090, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The race across animal species begins!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Which is faster—horses or lions?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What about ostriches and camels??</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find out the answers to these questions through this simulation racing game.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Race Mode</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aim for victory in animal races held on the stadium track.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players must decide team orders based on the animals' condition, requiring strategic thinking to win numerous races.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For example, in the 400m dash, you can deploy up to 4 runners and allocate distances to tackle the race.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even if your opponent is a bear, a relay team of a human and a cat might just win!?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Marathon Mode</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Need faster teammates to win races?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Head out for a marathon-style run game outside the track to find new allies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You might encounter fast animals you've never met before.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 40 different animals are playable!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switch to any animal you discover and enjoy time attack challenges.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gallery Mode</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Admire the animals' mysterious appearances, voices, and movements.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The race across animal species begins!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Which is faster—horses or lions?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What about ostriches and camels??</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find out the answers to these questions through this simulation racing game.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Race Mode</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aim for victory in animal races held on the stadium track.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players must decide team orders based on the animals' condition, requiring strategic thinking to win numerous races.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For example, in the 400m dash, you can deploy up to 4 runners and allocate distances to tackle the race.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even if your opponent is a bear, a relay team of a human and a cat might just win!?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Marathon Mode</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Need faster teammates to win races?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Head out for a marathon-style run game outside the track to find new allies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You might encounter fast animals you've never met before.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 40 different animals are playable!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switch to any animal you discover and enjoy time attack challenges.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gallery Mode</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Admire the animals' mysterious appearances, voices, and movements.</p>", "short_description": "A relay race beyond species barriers! Play with over 40 different animals!", "supported_languages": "English, Japanese, Spanish - Spain, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Korean", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713090/68db680da078d41747d04dc08209d4d53382f992/header.jpg?t=1770997843", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713090/8ee3e9dddb03ea3c30b93dfeeee5bba85dc37112/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770997843", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713090/8ee3e9dddb03ea3c30b93dfeeee5bba85dc37112/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770997843", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5 (11世代以降)<br>